[en.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_DOUBLE]
Muffin Roulette: §YDoubling Contract§!

[en.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_DOUBLE_desc]
Double the reward or penalty of the next opened box.

§YOnly effective in this game.§!
§YIf you drop the next box, the effect will extend to the box after that.§!

[zh.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_DOUBLE]
马芬轮盘赌：§Y双倍协议§!

[zh.DECISION_C03_MUFFIN_ROULETTE_DOUBLE_desc]
双倍下一个被打开盒子的奖励或惩罚。

§Y仅在本局游戏生效。§!
§Y如果你放弃下一个盒子，效果会延伸到下下个盒子。§!
